## [Calculate Digit Sum of a String](https://leetcode.com/problems/calculate-digit-sum-of-a-string/)

### Approach: String Simulation

- Traverse the string in groups of size `k`.
- Calculate the sum of digits in each group.
- Append the calculated sum to a new string.
- Replace the original string with the newly generated string.
- Repeat until the string length becomes less than or equal to `k`.

### Code

```cpp
class Solution {
public:
    string digitSum(string s, int k) {
        while(s.length() > k) {
            string res = "";
            int index = 0;

            while(index < s.length()) {
                int end = min(index + k, (int)s.length());
                string temp = s.substr(index, end - index);

                index = end;
                int sum = 0;

                for(char ch : temp) {
                    sum += (ch - '0');
                }

                res += to_string(sum);
            }

            s = res;
        }

        return s;
    }
};
```

### Complexity Analysis

- **Time Complexity:** \(O(n \log_k n)\) approximately, for \(k > 1\).
- **Space Complexity:** \(O(n)\) for the temporary strings.
